Chapter: CardEmitDemo
  cites Explorer chapter CardEmitter
  cites Explorer chapter WorldModel
  cites CodexMagic chapter Card

 We say:

  demo-text : Integer -> Text
  demo-text (x) =
    let cards = entities-to-cards camelot-entities 0 (list-length camelot-entities) []
    in "=== Camelot card set (lowered from WorldModel entities) ===\n\n"
       & format-set cards 0 (list-length cards) ""

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (demo-text 0)
  end
